{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-07T10:39:47.447Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"54ac87379db6592d81af1cc6","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1665","claim:pm-gh1666","claim:pm-gh1667","lineage:pm-gh1667","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1665+pm-gh1666+pm-gh1667","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1665","claim:pm-gh1666","claim:pm-gh1667","lineage:pm-gh1667","lineage:pm-9rgaal","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.319","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-07T10:39:47.446Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Codex review round 4 (gpt-6.1-sol, xhigh) found three P2 items:\n- Fixed: the shared coercer folded a lower-cased short alias into another flag's own key, so with --sort-order/-S and an independent --s, { s: \"lower\", sortOrder: \"upper\" } lost s (on direct calls and on CLI argv dispatch alike). coerceLooseCommandOptionsWithFlagDefinitions now drops alias spellings that are another declaration's canonical key; regressions cover both the direct normalizer and the coercer.\n- Fixed: typeof HiddenClass.prototype resolved to the synthetic prototype symbol and bypassed the gate; the owning class is now resolved like an enum member.\n- Deferred to pm-bqyk1z with the repro: a callable value annotated with an exported alias (type Runner = (o: Hidden) => void) whose own parameter type is unexported. That is the transitive type-declaration closure pm-bqyk1z owns.\nConvergence note: rounds found 4, 4, 3, 3 items, each round a narrower declaration form or alias composition; the remaining class is the closure work already scoped in pm-bqyk1z.\n"}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-07T10:39:47.447Z"}],"before_hash":"51592c725dd6198002f8ca4945872cee1f98883fdb2f996644fede9c9b49bc8b","after_hash":"18908950743e7468345e2662bcca0b8ee19e13fe2db0b45944ffc4de468e6e4e","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"1a1b8f0588ece3e25fc3483228fe0330703d06e1d6b15a4db8e131997dfa83af"}
